"<p>Configure notification channels under <strong>Settings -> Notifications</strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Discord &#x26; Slack:</strong> Webhook integrations.</li>\n<li><strong>Telegram:</strong> Bot Token and Chat ID.</li>\n<li><strong>Email:</strong> SMTP configuration.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Supported trigger events include deployment successes/failures, scheduled backup errors, and auto-update notifications.</p>"